  "text": "\r\n\t\t Voting & Elections | Hampstead, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     Community   \t\t\t \n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Boards & Committees   \t\t\t \n     How Do I...   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \n\t\t\t Boat Registration \r\n\t\t\t Dog Licenses \r\n\t\t\t EREG - Motor Vehicle Renewals \r\n\t\t\t EREG - Registration Estimates \r\n\t\t\t Assessing \r\n\t\t\t Marriage Licenses \r\n\t\t\t Motor Vehicle Registration \r\n\t\t\t NH DES Permit Information \r\n\t\t\t New Resident Information \r\n\t\t\t Property Tax Information \r\n\t\t\t\t Property Tax Relief Program \r\n\t\t\t Tax Rate \r\n\t\t\t Transfer Station & Beach Stickers \r\n\t\t\t Vital Records \r\n\t\t\t Voting & Elections \r\n\t\t\t Hunting & Fishing Licenses \r\n\t\t\t Abatement Application \r\nHome \nDepartments \nTown Clerk / Tax Collector \nVoting & Elections \r\nVoting & Elections\t\t \r\nUpcoming Elections: \nTuesday, November 3, 2026 - NH State General Election \nAll voting takes place at the Hampstead Middle School, 28 School Street, Hampstead,  NH 03841.  Polls are open 8:00am - 8:00pm. \n    SAMPLE BALLOT FOR STATE OF NH GENERAL ELECTION - NOVEMBER 3, 2026 \nPlease click the links below for more voting information. \nCompleted  ABSENTEE BALLOT APPLICATIONS  and all supporting documentation can be submitted either: \nIn person to the Town Clerk's Office, 11 Main Street, Hampstead, NH during our regular business hours of Monday through Thursday 7 am to 4 pm, Friday 7 am to noon \nMail: Hampstead Town Clerk, P.O. Box 298, Hampstead, NH 03841 \nEmail to the Town Clerk \nMAKE SURE TO INCLUDE ALL SUPPORTING DOCUMENTATION WITH YOUR APPLICATION.  See section VI. \nCheck the Status of My Absentee Ballot \r\nQuick Links \r\n         Check my party affiliation \n         Supervisors of the Checklist \n         Check My Voter Registration \n         Voter Registration and Information \n         Supervisors of the Checklist \n         Voter information and FAQ's \n         REGISTERING TO VOTE IN NH \n         Uniformed and overseas citizens (UOCAVA) \n         Student Guide to Voting in NH \n         Student Guide to Registering to Vote \n         View All Quick Links \r\n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nElection Results \r\nTown Results - March 10, 2026 \r\nSchool District Results - March 10, 2026 \r\nNH General Election Results November 5, 2024 (PDF) \r\nNH State Primary Results September 10, 2024 (PDF) \r\nTown and School District Results March 11, 2025 (PDF) \r\nTown and School District Results March 12, 2024 (PDF) \r\nTown and School District Results March 14, 2023 (PDF) \r\nAbsentee Ballot Request \r\nNH State Primary -  Democratic Results (Hampstead)  \r\nNH State Primary -  Republican Results (Hampstead)  \r\nSample - General Election 11-3-2026 (pdf) \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \r\n\t\t\t Online Payments & Services \r\n\t\t\t GIS/Assessing \r\n\t\t\t Trash & Recycling \r\n\t\t\t Zoning \r\n\t\t\t Contact Us \r\nContact Us \r\n11 Main Street \nHampstead, NH 03841 \nPhone:  603-329-4100 \r\nQuick Links \r\n         Business Directory \n         Calendar \n         FAQs \n         Forms \n         News \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nSite Links \r\n         Home \n         Site Map \n         Contact Us \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n     Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
